   "section": "A",
   "section_title": "CI & build pipeline",
   "problem": "ld.lld: undefined symbol ggml_threadpool_new / ggml_threadpool_free",
   "cause": "threadpool API lives in the CPU backend (ggml-cpu.c), dlopen'd under GGML_BACKEND_DL=ON \u2014 not linkable from native-lib",
   "solution": "pin the calling decode thread before first graph compute; pthreads inherit creator affinity; no direct ggml-cpu link; -llog for logcat",
