   "id": "A16",
   "section": "A",
   "section_title": "CI & build pipeline",
   "problem": "memory retrieval ranked by hand-rolled linear recency, not the spec's BM25 \u00d7 exponential decay",
   "cause": "Phase 2 scoring predated the math spec (score = utility*0.5 + recency*0.3 + success*0.2)",
   "solution": "ftsCandidates selects bm25(experiences_fts) AS bm25_rank; score = -rank * exp(-0.05*ageDays) + small tiebreaks; decay SQL lambda 0.02 -> 0.05",
   "tags": [
    "fts5",
